Robot2 mode: the legacy 2015 strategy, see docs/legacy-robot2-strategy.md.
SMA over bar midpoints, ending at the current bar. A side arms when the bar
touches avg+-diffLevel1 (touch = level inside the bar or in the gap to the
previous bar) and fires when the armed side touches avg+-diffLevel2: a limit
order goes orderStartDelta pips back from that level, cancelled if the price
runs profLimit away first. Fixed TP=profLimit, SL=lossLimit from the entry.
Many trades can be open at once; a new one is dropped when an open trade of
the same direction sits within 50 pips. Faithfully reproduced legacy quirks:
the high level is checked first, so a bar covering both brackets is a win
for buys and a loss for sells; re-arming drops the pending order; fills are
checked before cancels on the same bar; a trade can close on its entry bar.
